NVD fMRIPrep 25.2.5 derivatives

20 participants; 34 runs each (33 image-viewing runs and one resting run).
No fieldmap/susceptibility distortion correction was applied (--ignore fieldmaps).
One T1w acquisition (ses-101) per subject was used for all functional sessions.
FreeSurfer reconstructions were reused; per-BOLD fMRIPrep anatomical processing
was independently executed. The standard anatomical tree is from the rest run.
Exact anatomy/transforms referenced by individual functional sidecars are kept
under provenance/<run-key>/anat and addressed by bids::provenance/ URIs. They are not
silently replaced by the representative anatomical tree.
T1w, MNI152NLin2009cAsym, fsLR 91k CIFTI, fsLR 32k left/right GIFTI, masks,
boldrefs, transformations, and confounds retain original functional entities.
The 91k CIFTI includes cortex at fsLR32k and MNI152NLin6Asym subcortical voxels.
Frame counts vary by acquisition; TR is 1 s. Confound initial n/a is preserved.
provenance/*_run_inventory.tsv records actual frame counts and anatomical source.
Work directories, intermediate native surfaces, scheduler logs, failed products,
software licenses and credentials are excluded. Binary contents are unmodified.
Source: OpenNeuro ds007354 snapshot 2.0.5, CC0.
